\details{
For this engine, there is a single mode: classification
\subsection{Tuning Parameters}{

This model has 2 tuning parameters:
\itemize{
\item \code{ordinal_link}: Ordinal Link (type: character, default: logistic)
\item \code{penalty}: Amount of Regularization (type: double, default: 0)
}

\code{ordinal_link} is passed to the native \code{family} argument and \code{penalty}
is passed directly to the native \code{penalty} argument.
}

